Forwarding MongoDB's latest public statements (Nasdaq: MDB), summarized for diligence. Public company, so no funding round.

MongoDB reported second quarter fiscal 2027 total revenue of $771.8 million, up 30% year-over-year (September 1, 2026).
Atlas revenue was up approximately 29% year-over-year in the second quarter fiscal 2027.
MongoDB raised full year fiscal 2027 revenue guidance to $2.99 billion to $3.03 billion.
Full year fiscal 2026 total revenue was $2.46 billion, up 23% year-over-year.
MongoDB had over 65,200 total customers as of January 31, 2026, including 2,799 customers over $100K in ARR.
More than 60,000 customers, including approximately 75% of the Fortune 100, rely on MongoDB.
As of January 31, 2026, MongoDB had a total of 5,636 employees, including 2,927 employees located outside the United States.
CJ Desai is President and Chief Executive Officer. Mike Berry is Chief Financial Officer.
MongoDB is headquartered in New York.

